# Castle document roots for mediatron.
#
# One URL prefix per line; lines starting with '#' are comments.
# A link whose URL starts with any listed prefix is treated as internal
# (it opens in the mediatron window). Everything else over http(s) is
# external and opens in the default browser when followed with `F`.
#
# Copy this file to ~/.config/mediatron/config (or set MEDIATRON_CONFIG)
# and edit the prefixes to name where your castle serves its documents.
# Your private roots belong here, in your private configuration, never in
# the repository.
